      "Flexible, seamless membrane bridges hairline cracks",
      "Water-based and solvent-free",
      "Brush, roll or spray application",
      "Suited to positive-side use on exposed foundation walls"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Must be built to recommended thickness, which takes several coats",
      "Expensive per square foot over large areas",
      "Needs drainage board and a footing drain to perform as a system"
